#: ../../source/example_gallery/fluid/index.rst:2
#: a93b51a1a3994a0383a1f02105d0280c
msgid "Fluid Mechanics"
msgstr "流体力学"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/fluid/index.rst:4
#: 41a64bed455d45329b3d9dc368b47022
msgid ""
"A family of worked incompressible-flow examples in ``examples/fluid/``, from"
" a manufactured Stokes problem with a convergence study to Rayleigh-Bénard "
"convection coupling momentum and energy. They are all built on **Taylor-Hood"
" P2-P1 mixed assembly**: a quadratic velocity and a linear pressure declared"
" on one :class:`~tensormesh.MixedElementAssembler`, so the pair is inf-sup "
"(LBB) stable and the weak form *is* the whole discretization — no SUPG/PSPG "
"stabilization, no ``tau`` tuning."
msgstr ""
"``examples/fluid/`` 目录下包含一组完整的不可压缩流动算例，从带收敛性分析的人工构造 Stokes 问题，到耦合动量与能量的瑞利-"
"贝纳德对流。它们全部基于 **Taylor-Hood P2-P1 混合装配**\\ ：二次速度场与线性压力场在同一个 "
":class:`~tensormesh.MixedElementAssembler` 上声明，因此该速度-压力对满足 inf-"
"sup（LBB）稳定性条件，且弱形式 *即* 全部离散化——无需 SUPG/PSPG 稳定化，也无需调节 ``tau`` 参数。"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/fluid/index.rst:13
#: ac974eee55184609aa6d40473d140d28
msgid ""
"The recipe is shared across the family (read :doc:`stokes_taylor_hood` "
"first, then the rest are physics and boundary-condition variations):"
msgstr "该系列算例共享同一套实现框架（请先阅读 :doc:`stokes_taylor_hood`\\ ，其余均为物理模型与边界条件的变体）："

#: ../../source/example_gallery/fluid/index.rst:17
#: 4fbe1aab33834279b28202e6a3bae7c6
msgid ""
"declare ``Field(trial=\"u\", test=\"v\", order=2, components=d)`` and "
"``Field(trial=\"p\", test=\"q\", order=1)``, write the scalar integrand in "
"``forward``;"
msgstr ""
"声明 ``Field(trial=\"u\", test=\"v\", order=2, components=d)`` 与 "
"``Field(trial=\"p\", test=\"q\", order=1)``\\ ，在 ``forward`` 中编写标量被积函数；"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/fluid/index.rst:20
#: ef83290f2395454abe4e90f6e3e6066c
msgid ""
"steady problems linearize convection with **Picard** (the lagged velocity "
"enters as data), transient ones add a backward-Euler mass term and a "
"``forward_vector`` load;"
msgstr ""
"定常问题采用 **Picard** 迭代对对流项进行线性化（滞后速度作为已知数据代入），非定常问题则添加后向 Euler 质量项以及 "
"``forward_vector`` 载荷；"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/fluid/index.rst:23
#: 6239a6108ef348abb3c84f49dd989694
msgid ""
"boundary conditions go through ``assembler.layout`` masks and the unchanged "
":class:`~tensormesh.Condenser`."
msgstr ""
"边界条件通过 ``assembler.layout`` 掩码以及未作改动的 :class:`~tensormesh.Condenser` 施加。"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/fluid/index.rst:26
#: 35deedb98b0048f49ead4d3a2c1478cb
msgid ""
"On generated order-2 meshes the velocity nodes coincide with the mesh "
"points; on linear gmsh/:class:`~tensormesh.MeshGen` meshes (cylinder, "
"obstacles) the quadratic space is created **topologically** — no re-meshing "
"at order 2. See :doc:`../../user_guide/mixed_assembly` for the machinery."
msgstr ""
"在生成的二阶网格上，速度节点与网格点重合；对于线性 gmsh/:class:`~tensormesh.MeshGen` "
"网格（圆柱、障碍物等），二次空间通过 **拓扑方式** 构造——无需在二阶下进行重新网格化。具体机制参见 "
":doc:`../../user_guide/mixed_assembly`\\ 。"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/fluid/index.rst:35
#: 97287f70ecd64d36aed640726dc45ac7
msgid "Taylor-Hood Stokes"
msgstr "Taylor-Hood Stokes"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/fluid/index.rst:40
#: 131c2c5fb9ae45eeb457c4b73fb1c308
msgid ""
"Manufactured Stokes solution + convergence study — the mixed-assembly "
"tutorial."
msgstr "人工构造 Stokes 解 + 收敛性分析——混合装配教程。"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/fluid/index.rst:42
#: 9287bc072a8445da98678e82068a7a03
msgid "Lid-Driven Cavity"
msgstr "顶盖驱动方腔"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/fluid/index.rst:47
#: 3f3f7f14f6d8411181ecec8a9f162b88
msgid ""
"Steady NS at Re=100, Picard iteration — in 2D and 3D with one dimension-"
"generic weak form."
msgstr "Re=100 的定常 NS 方程，Picard 迭代——以单个维度通用的弱形式实现二维与三维算例。"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/fluid/index.rst:50
#: 689170ec077640f68af8870d0a478f60
msgid "Cylinder Flow (Vortex Shedding)"
msgstr "圆柱绕流（涡脱落）"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/fluid/index.rst:55
#: 9af219541009414bb1c98df2de98441a
msgid ""
"Transient DFG benchmark: backward Euler, topological P2 on a gmsh mesh, "
"vorticity via mixed load vectors."
msgstr "非定常 DFG 基准算例：后向 Euler、gmsh 网格上的拓扑 P2、通过混合载荷向量计算涡量。"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/fluid/index.rst:58
#: 759d6a803f48404c9002199be8b7326e
msgid "Flow Past Multiple Obstacles"
msgstr "绕多个障碍物的流动"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/fluid/index.rst:63
#: 79c67bce473d40eeb579fa5bd94251a9
msgid ""
"Steady channel flow at Re=150 around six circular obstacles via MeshGen CSG."
msgstr "Re=150 的稳态通道流，绕六个圆形障碍物，网格通过 MeshGen 的 CSG 构造。"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/fluid/index.rst:65
#: 84946935c07748e28ff9ebde68a0c604
msgid "Rayleigh-Bénard Convection"
msgstr "瑞利-贝纳德对流"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/fluid/index.rst:70
#: 5df6b51cd7824acfbf312b234ecd684a
msgid ""
"Three-field Boussinesq system — velocity, pressure, and temperature in one "
"block matrix."
msgstr "三场 Boussinesq 系统——速度、压力与温度统一纳入一个块矩阵。"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/fluid/index.rst:73
#: 97287f70ecd64d36aed640726dc45ac7
msgid "Taylor-Green Vortex"
msgstr "泰勒-格林涡"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/fluid/index.rst:78
#: 82705f00dea445d292494e24ccdfa13b
msgid "Decaying vortex with exact solution — the convergence-study showcase."
msgstr "具有精确解的衰减涡——收敛性研究的范例。"

